    "active": true,
    "description": "<p><em>Weapon (Mace), Rare</em></p><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. The bonus increases to +3 when you use the weapon to attack a Construct.</p><p>When you roll a 20 on an attack roll made with this weapon, the target takes an extra 7 Bludgeoning damage, or 14 Bludgeoning damage if it's a Construct. If a Construct has 25 Hit Points or fewer after taking this damage, it is destroyed.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-9gH19qmKr4AEgExV\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Attack Construct</strong> activity automatically includes the additional bonuses.</p></section>",
